{"parse": {"title": "TTC-06", "pageid": 55398, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTC-05\" title=\"TTC-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTC-06</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.8B.A9.E7.8C.8E.E6.84.89.E5.BF.AB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"狩猎愉快\">狩猎愉快</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 狩猎愉快</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Happy Hunting</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>“<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>个<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>贯<span class=\"color-value\"></span>彻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>己<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>信<span class=\"color-value\"></span>念<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>需<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>弃<span class=\"color-value\"></span>暗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>投<span class=\"color-value\"></span>明<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>”<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191206</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黄昏的宁静氛围渐渐笼罩在整座城市上空，使得从通讯器里传出来的声音听起来像是遥远的烟火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>请联系维也纳警方派一辆警车来解救人质。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会女职员：</div><div>塞梅尔维斯小姐，既然你已经抓到了超自然者，为什么不立即联系基金会？为什么要自作主张将她放走？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我相信你们能把她带去一个更好的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>可是现在她还不能就这样离开，因为她还有必须完成的工作要做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会女职员：</div><div>你要为擅自释放超自然者导致维也纳市民再次置身险境的结果负责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我知道，我个人会扛下这个责任。但无论如何基金会都留不住她的，因为她有信念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会女职员：</div><div>一个有信念的血食怪吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>一个人想要贯彻自己的信念，是不需要“弃暗投明”的。当然追根究底，我只是不想被这种道德矛盾搞到头昏脑胀罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>有时真相就是如此，不是吗？当你发现真相并不像你所以为的那样黑白分明……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>当你发现多数情况下，邪恶的成分很少，而弱点的成分很多，很多不幸的故事都可以在自己的内心深处找到答案……于是我们便开始学会灵活办事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我会在报告里说明：我去维也纳度假并且热心协助当地警方维护庆典秩序，而所谓的失踪案只是艺术家一次小小的集体出走之旅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会女职员：</div><div>集体出走之旅？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>对，没有特定主题的集体出走之旅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯走上环城大道。此刻距离庆典结束只剩下最后一个小时，人们从她身边匆匆走过，露出或是满足或是疲惫的微笑，把握最后的时间采购礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看到一张熟悉的面孔，他正站在甜品展览台旁沉思，双脚不断改变站姿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>来一份萨赫蛋糕，谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>嗯……这个口感……很奇特，如果再撒上一些干胡椒粉，增添些许辛辣的风味会更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狼群：</div><div>简妮特这次制作的萨赫蛋糕采用的杏仁是用占边威士忌浸泡过的，因此相比常规的杏仁酱口感上更加圆润醇厚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狼群：</div><div>不同于纯威士忌，占边威士忌用的水是来自肯塔基州克勒蒙区酿酒厂附近的水源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>你知道水源之类的说法其实都是鬼话连篇吧？相比之下，我唯一关注的是价格标签上的数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>什么都要杀价，这就是重点，你知道吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狼群：</div><div>显然你不是甜品艺术的行家，不知道这块又大又香的蛋糕抢手得很。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308811.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-308811.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308811.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308811.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-308811.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308811.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-308811.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308811.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>是吗？那么或许我会在这里多买几份，看看能不能对甜品艺术生出一点兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狼群：</div><div>买？我们应该采取“最厉害的家伙先上”的规则直接瓜分它！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308811.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-308811.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308811.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308811.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-308811.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308811.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-308811.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308811.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狼群：</div><div>这是一个经由我自己制定并且正在积极落实的规则，就像“最厉害的家伙最后一个来上班”特权一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>很遗憾，现在已经是下班时间了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>麻烦再来一份。噢，可以顺便加一些干胡椒粉给我吗？用我自带的就好。谢谢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>占用你的一点时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狼群：</div><div>有事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我是来和同事打招呼的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>维也纳警方已经成功将人质救出。艾勒梅和玛蒂娜承认了她们合伙窃取顾客订单的行为，诺娜·伊斯特表示会加急制作司辰预订的彩蛋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>应该会比预期延迟几天完成，但你不用担心向司辰交差的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>之前谈起动机的时候，你说我应该从“钱”开始。起初我不懂你的意思，现在我明白了，你说得对，但我以为你指的是绑匪，不是你自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狼群：</div><div>我指的是所有的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>说起来，我记得你不是说已经向司辰提了辞职信吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>那么你有新工作的目标吗？比如说安保公司，或者催债公司之类的？一定会有很多催债公司需要你这种有“法律背景”的员工。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>但可能也有很多公司不希望看见应聘者的工作记录里注明了“无故缺勤”、“不服从上级命令”的条目……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我可以帮你介绍一些不那么挑剔的公司，但我想你应该不需要我的帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯将萨赫蛋糕递到狼群的面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>所以我只给你准备了这个。算我请你的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狼群：</div><div>你说完了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>嗯。再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狼群吃下一口蛋糕，塞梅尔维斯看见他脸上掌管微笑的肌肉抖了抖。他的下颌肌肉持续碾磨着，咀嚼着蛋糕，随后逐渐失去控制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他向塞梅尔维斯怒目而视，似乎想对她说些什么，看口型像是某句意大利脏话，但他的嘴角已经不受控制地抽动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯迅速转身，迈步朝多瑙河的方向走去。经过一处拐角时，她将口袋里的健康检查报告撕成碎片丢进垃圾桶，露出微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“鱼缸脸”曾向塞梅尔维斯提起过她正在撰写一篇关于愉悦的研究文章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她说，如果以一个人血液中测量出的血清素浓度为基准点，会发现很少有外在因素能影响这个浓度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但倘若一个人曾与死亡进行过贴面礼，在那之后他的血清素浓度就会飙升到感觉到愉悦的最高点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同时“鱼缸脸”也发现，有一个条目对一个人是否感觉愉悦也至关重要。正是它促使了塞梅尔维斯的第三种醒来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此时它就握在她手中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/Cg-1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/Cg-1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/Cg-1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯走下列车，站在原地，鼻子吸入温暖的空气。她听见车门关闭，感觉身后的空气随着列车驶离而流动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她把手伸进外套的口袋深处，拿出一块巧克力放入口中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巧克力在她的口中上下晃动、融化，她感觉自己的太阳穴神经产生了一种奇特又愉悦的震动，这种感觉扩散到全身，令她露出微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>不好意思我又迟到了，队长，这里的交通状况实在是……地图上明明看起来不远，可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>你没出车祸真是不可思议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>哈、哈哈……队长，你看起来好像心情不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>因为我睡了个好觉。你的蕈虫脂后遗症还没好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>哈！先别管我了！看看外面的天气吧！今天可是个艳阳高照的晴天噢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>是吗？那么这次我要试点不一样的战术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>哈哈……看来你的冬眠已经结束了。那么，祝你“狩猎愉快”，队长。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTC-06"}}